{"seq":2,"slug":"native-platform-features","title":"原生平台能力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/capabilities-and-deploy/native-platform-features","wordCount":1838,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"原生平台能力\">原生平台能力</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Project Fugu（Google 2018 年发起）是 Chrome 团队的计划——为 Web 平台提供更多原生能力，缩小 Web 与原生应用之间的差距。File System Access（文件系统访问）、Web Bluetooth（蓝牙）、Web USB、Web NFC、Web Serial（串口）、Web HID（人机接口设备）、Idle Detection（空闲检测）、Periodic Background Sync（周期性后台同步）、Web Share（分享）、Clipboard（剪贴板）、Geolocation（地理位置）、Camera/Mic（摄像头/麦克风）、Wake Lock（屏幕唤醒锁）、Contact Picker（联系人选择器）——大量 API 让 PWA 接近原生应用的能力。但各浏览器支持情况并不统一：Chrome 积极跟进、Safari 相对保守、Firefox 居中。本节涵盖现代 Web 平台能力概览、典型使用场景、权限体验设计、以及回退策略。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API</th>\n<th>Chrome</th>\n<th>Safari</th>\n<th>Firefox</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>File System Access</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>编辑本地文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web Bluetooth</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>物联网、健康设备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web USB</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>硬件集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web NFC</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>NFC 标签读写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web Share</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>调用系统分享菜单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Clipboard</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>复制/粘贴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Geolocation</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>定位服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Camera / Mic</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>视频/音频采集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wake Lock</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>防止屏幕休眠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Periodic Background Sync</td>\n<td>✓</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>✗</td>\n<td>周期性内容刷新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"file-system-access-文件系统访问\">File System Access（文件系统访问）</h2><p><strong>读写用户文件系统</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 打开文件选择器&#10;const [fileHandle] = await window.showOpenFilePicker({&#10;  types: [{ description: &#39;Markdown&#39;, accept: { &#39;text/markdown&#39;: [&#39;.md&#39;] } }],&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 读取文件内容&#10;const file = await fileHandle.getFile();&#10;const content = await file.text();&#10;&#10;// 写入文件&#10;const writable = await fileHandle.createWritable();&#10;await writable.write(&#39;Hello!&#39;);&#10;await writable.close();&#10;&#10;// 另存为&#10;const saveHandle = await window.showSaveFilePicker({&#10;  suggestedName: &#39;doc.md&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 打开文件选择器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const [fileHandle] = await window.showOpenFilePicker({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  types: [{ description: 'Markdown', accept: { 'text/markdown': ['.md'] } }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 读取文件内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const file = await fileHandle.getFile();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const content = await file.text();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 写入文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const writable = await fileHandle.createWritable();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await writable.write('Hello!');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await writable.close();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 另存为</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const saveHandle = await window.showSaveFilePicker({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  suggestedName: 'doc.md',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>与传统 <code>&lt;input type=&quot;file&quot;&gt;</code> 的区别</strong>：传统方式只能上传（单向读取），File System Access 支持真正的文件系统读写操作。</p>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：替代原生文本编辑器、浏览器中的 IDE（如 VS Code Web）、图片编辑器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"opfs-origin-private-file-system-源私有文件系统\">OPFS（Origin Private File System，源私有文件系统）</h2><p><strong>应用专属的私有文件系统</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const opfsRoot = await navigator.storage.getDirectory();&#10;const fileHandle = await opfsRoot.getFileHandle(&#39;data.txt&#39;, { create: true });&#10;const writable = await fileHandle.createWritable();&#10;await writable.write(&#39;Hello!&#39;);&#10;await writable.close();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const opfsRoot = await navigator.storage.getDirectory();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const fileHandle = await opfsRoot.getFileHandle('data.txt', { create: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const writable = await fileHandle.createWritable();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await writable.write('Hello!');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await writable.close();</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>与 IndexedDB 的区别</strong>：提供类文件系统的 API，对二进制数据的性能更好，仅限应用私有访问。</p>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：WebAssembly 文件系统、本地 SQLite 数据库（sqlite-wasm）、大型二进制数据缓存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"web-bluetooth-蓝牙\">Web Bluetooth（蓝牙）</h2><p><strong>连接蓝牙设备</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const device = await navigator.bluetooth.requestDevice({&#10;  filters: [{ services: [&#39;heart_rate&#39;] }],&#10;});&#10;const server = await device.gatt.connect();&#10;const service = await server.getPrimaryService(&#39;heart_rate&#39;);&#10;const characteristic = await service.getCharacteristic(&#39;heart_rate_measurement&#39;);&#10;&#10;characteristic.addEventListener(&#39;characteristicvaluechanged&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(event.target.value);&#10;});&#10;await characteristic.startNotifications();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const device = await navigator.bluetooth.requestDevice({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filters: [{ services: ['heart_rate'] }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const server = await device.gatt.connect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const service = await server.getPrimaryService('heart_rate');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const characteristic = await service.getCharacteristic('heart_rate_measurement');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>characteristic.addEventListener('characteristicvaluechanged', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(event.target.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await characteristic.startNotifications();</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：健康设备（心率监测仪）、物联网设备（智能灯泡）、玩具互动。</p>\n<p><strong>支持情况</strong>：仅 Chrome / Edge / Opera 支持，Safari 和 Firefox 不支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"web-usb\">Web USB</h2><p><strong>连接 USB 设备</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const device = await navigator.usb.requestDevice({&#10;  filters: [{ vendorId: 0x1234 }],&#10;});&#10;await device.open();&#10;await device.selectConfiguration(1);&#10;await device.claimInterface(0);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const device = await navigator.usb.requestDevice({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filters: [{ vendorId: 0x1234 }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await device.open();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await device.selectConfiguration(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await device.claimInterface(0);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：硬件编程器（Arduino）、游戏控制器、工业设备。</p>\n<h2 id=\"web-nfc\">Web NFC</h2><p><strong>读写 NFC 标签</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const reader = new NDEFReader();&#10;await reader.scan();&#10;reader.addEventListener(&#39;reading&#39;, ({ message, serialNumber }) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(serialNumber);&#10;  for (const record of message.records) {&#10;    console.log(record.recordType, record.data);&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const reader = new NDEFReader();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await reader.scan();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reader.addEventListener('reading', ({ message, serialNumber }) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(serialNumber);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (const record of message.records) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    console.log(record.recordType, record.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：库存标签管理、公交卡、智能海报。</p>\n<p><strong>支持情况</strong>：目前仅 Android Chrome 支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"web-share-api-分享\">Web Share API（分享）</h2><p><strong>调用系统原生分享菜单</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"if (navigator.share) {&#10;  await navigator.share({&#10;    title: &#39;我的应用&#39;,&#10;    text: &#39;看看这个&#39;,&#10;    url: &#39;https://example.com&#39;,&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>if (navigator.share) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await navigator.share({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    title: '我的应用',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    text: '看看这个',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    url: 'https://example.com',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>支持情况</strong>：Chrome / Safari / Edge 移动端和桌面端均广泛支持，Firefox 有限支持。</p>\n<p><strong>Web Share Target（接收分享）</strong>：通过清单文件（manifest）配置，让 PWA 能接收来自其他应用的分享内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"clipboard-api-剪贴板\">Clipboard API（剪贴板）</h2><p><strong>复制文本</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"await navigator.clipboard.writeText(&#39;Hello&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>await navigator.clipboard.writeText('Hello');</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>粘贴文本</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const text = await navigator.clipboard.readText();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const text = await navigator.clipboard.readText();</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>读取图片</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const items = await navigator.clipboard.read();&#10;for (const item of items) {&#10;  if (item.types.includes(&#39;image/png&#39;)) {&#10;    const blob = await item.getType(&#39;image/png&#39;);&#10;    // 使用 blob&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const items = await navigator.clipboard.read();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (const item of items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (item.types.includes('image/png')) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const blob = await item.getType('image/png');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 使用 blob</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>权限要求</strong>：读取需要用户手势加权限授权；写入需要用户手势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"geolocation-地理位置\">Geolocation（地理位置）</h2><p><strong>标准定位 API</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition((pos) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(pos.coords.latitude, pos.coords.longitude);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 持续监听位置变化&#10;const id = navigator.geolocation.watchPosition((pos) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(pos.coords);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition((pos) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(pos.coords.latitude, pos.coords.longitude);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 持续监听位置变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const id = navigator.geolocation.watchPosition((pos) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(pos.coords);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>权限要求</strong>：需要用户明确授权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"camera-mic-摄像头-麦克风\">Camera / Mic（摄像头/麦克风）</h2><p><strong>获取媒体流</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({&#10;  video: { facingMode: &#39;user&#39; },&#10;  audio: true,&#10;});&#10;&#10;videoElement.srcObject = stream;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const stream = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  video: { facingMode: 'user' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  audio: true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>videoElement.srcObject = stream;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：视频通话、二维码扫描、语音输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wake-lock-屏幕唤醒锁\">Wake Lock（屏幕唤醒锁）</h2><p><strong>保持屏幕常亮</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const wakeLock = await navigator.wakeLock.request(&#39;screen&#39;);&#10;&#10;wakeLock.addEventListener(&#39;release&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(&#39;唤醒锁已释放&#39;);&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 手动释放&#10;await wakeLock.release();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const wakeLock = await navigator.wakeLock.request('screen');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wakeLock.addEventListener('release', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('唤醒锁已释放');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 手动释放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await wakeLock.release();</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：菜谱应用（做饭时不休眠）、演示文稿、导航应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"periodic-background-sync-周期性后台同步\">Periodic Background Sync（周期性后台同步）</h2><p><strong>定期刷新内容</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const reg = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;&#10;await reg.periodicSync.register(&#39;refresh&#39;, {&#10;  minInterval: 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000, // 最小间隔 1 天&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const reg = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await reg.periodicSync.register('refresh', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  minInterval: 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000, // 最小间隔 1 天</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Service Worker 处理</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"self.addEventListener(&#39;periodicsync&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.tag === &#39;refresh&#39;) {&#10;    event.waitUntil(refreshContent());&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('periodicsync', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.tag === 'refresh') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event.waitUntil(refreshContent());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>限制</strong>：仅 Chrome 支持，需要已安装 PWA 且用户有使用频率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"idle-detection-空闲检测\">Idle Detection（空闲检测）</h2><p><strong>检测用户空闲状态</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const detector = new IdleDetector();&#10;await detector.start({ threshold: 60000 });&#10;&#10;detector.addEventListener(&#39;change&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(detector.userState, detector.screenState);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const detector = new IdleDetector();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await detector.start({ threshold: 60000 });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>detector.addEventListener('change', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(detector.userState, detector.screenState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：自动注销、在线状态更新（显示&quot;离开&quot;）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"contact-picker-联系人选择器\">Contact Picker（联系人选择器）</h2><p><strong>选择设备联系人</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const contacts = await navigator.contacts.select([&#39;name&#39;, &#39;email&#39;], { multiple: true });&#10;console.log(contacts);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const contacts = await navigator.contacts.select(['name', 'email'], { multiple: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(contacts);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：邀请联系人、分享给联系人。</p>\n<p><strong>支持情况</strong>：仅 Chrome Android 支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权限体验设计\">权限体验设计</h2><p><strong>在用户操作时请求权限</strong>：用户点击按钮后再请求，而非页面加载时立即弹出。</p>\n<p><strong>先说明原因</strong>：弹出类似&quot;我们需要使用摄像头来扫描二维码&quot;的解释对话框，然后再请求。</p>\n<p><strong>被拒绝后不纠缠</strong>：等待数天或数周后再考虑重新引导。</p>\n<p><strong>提供设置指引</strong>：如果用户拒绝了权限，教用户如何在浏览器设置中重新开启。</p>\n<p>这四条可以归纳为一份可执行的权限请求清单：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在用户操作时请求权限，而非页面加载时立即弹出。</li>\n<li>先说明原因，再触发系统权限弹窗。</li>\n<li>被拒绝后不纠缠，等待数天或数周后再考虑重新引导。</li>\n<li>提供设置指引，教用户如何在浏览器设置中重新开启。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户操作] --&gt; B[显示说明理由]&#10;    B --&gt; C{用户同意?}&#10;    C -- 是 --&gt; D[请求系统权限]&#10;    C -- 否 --&gt; E[不再请求]&#10;    D --&gt; F{授权?}&#10;    F -- 是 --&gt; G[使用功能]&#10;    F -- 否 --&gt; H[展示替代方案或引导设置]\">graph TD\n    A[用户操作] --&gt; B[显示说明理由]\n    B --&gt; C{用户同意?}\n    C -- 是 --&gt; D[请求系统权限]\n    C -- 否 --&gt; E[不再请求]\n    D --&gt; F{授权?}\n    F -- 是 --&gt; G[使用功能]\n    F -- 否 --&gt; H[展示替代方案或引导设置]</pre><h2 id=\"能力检测\">能力检测</h2><p><strong>使用前始终先检测</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"if (&#39;share&#39; in navigator) {&#10;  // 使用 Web Share&#10;} else {&#10;  // 回退方案：复制链接&#10;}&#10;&#10;if (&#39;serviceWorker&#39; in navigator) {&#10;  // 支持 PWA 能力&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>if ('share' in navigator) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 使用 Web Share</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 回退方案：复制链接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 支持 PWA 能力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"回退与渐进增强\">回退与渐进增强</h2><p><strong>许多原生 API 无法 polyfill</strong>：蓝牙、USB 等原生硬件 API 无法模拟。</p>\n<p><strong>可以 polyfill 的</strong>：Web Share 可回退为自定义分享菜单；Clipboard 可回退为 <code>document.execCommand</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>核心原则</strong>：渐进增强——基础功能在所有浏览器上可用，支持的平台提供更丰富的体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"project-fugu-追踪\">Project Fugu 追踪</h2><p><strong>持续发展中</strong>：每月都有新 API 推出，从 Chrome 实验标志 → 稳定版逐步推进。</p>\n<p><strong>追踪渠道</strong>：web.dev/fugu、chromestatus.com。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ios-平台限制\">iOS 平台限制</h2><p><strong>Apple 对新 Web API 的采纳速度较慢</strong>：大部分 Fugu API 在 iOS 上缺失。</p>\n<p><strong>应对策略</strong>：使用混合应用方案（Capacitor、原生壳），或提供原生回退。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私与安全\">隐私与安全</h2><p><strong>权限控制</strong>：地理位置、摄像头、麦克风、蓝牙等均需用户明确授权。必须使用 HTTPS。</p>\n<p><strong>用户信任</strong>：不要在没有说明原因的情况下请求权限；只请求最少必要的权限。</p>\n<p><strong>敏感数据</strong>：未经用户同意不要将原始数据发送给第三方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战案例\">实战案例</h2><p><strong>VS Code Web</strong>：使用 File System Access 实现文件编辑。</p>\n<p><strong>Squoosh（Google）</strong>：在浏览器中实现图片压缩，使用 File System Access 保存结果。</p>\n<p><strong>Spotify Web</strong>：使用 Media Session API 支持键盘快捷键和音频焦点。</p>\n<p><strong>Figma</strong>：使用 WebGL + Canvas 实现设计工具，使用 File System Access 导出文件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见反模式\">常见反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 页面加载立即请求权限</strong>：用户必然拒绝。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 不提供回退方案</strong>：Safari 用户功能失效。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 不解释请求原因</strong>：用户困惑不安。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 一次请求过多权限</strong>：给用户造成压力。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 不做优雅降级</strong>：API 不可用时应用崩溃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><p><strong>1. 先检测能力再使用</strong>：<code>if (&#39;feature&#39; in navigator)</code> 是必须的。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 说明请求原因</strong>：告诉用户为什么需要某个权限。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 始终提供回退方案</strong>：不支持的浏览器不应崩溃。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 渐进增强</strong>：核心功能在所有平台可用，部分平台提供增强体验。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 多浏览器测试</strong>：Chrome、Safari、Firefox 行为各异。</p>\n<p><strong>6. 持续关注平台能力更新</strong>：通过 web.dev 和 caniuse.com 追踪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Project Fugu 为 Web 平台带来了大量原生能力——File System Access 让 Web 应用能真正读写本地文件，OPFS 提供应用私有的高性能文件系统，Web Bluetooth 和 Web USB 连接硬件设备，Web Share 调用系统分享菜单，Wake Lock 防止屏幕休眠，Periodic Background Sync 定期刷新内容。但各浏览器支持差异显著，Chrome 最积极、Safari 最保守。工程实践的关键在于：始终先检测能力、提供回退方案、采用渐进增强策略、在用户操作时请求权限并说明原因。这些现代 Web API 让 PWA 越来越接近原生应用的体验，但必须考虑跨浏览器兼容性和优雅降级。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原生平台能力","id":"原生平台能力"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"File System Access（文件系统访问）","id":"file-system-access-文件系统访问"},{"level":2,"text":"OPFS（Origin Private File System，源私有文件系统）","id":"opfs-origin-private-file-system-源私有文件系统"},{"level":2,"text":"Web Bluetooth（蓝牙）","id":"web-bluetooth-蓝牙"},{"level":2,"text":"Web USB","id":"web-usb"},{"level":2,"text":"Web NFC","id":"web-nfc"},{"level":2,"text":"Web Share API（分享）","id":"web-share-api-分享"},{"level":2,"text":"Clipboard API（剪贴板）","id":"clipboard-api-剪贴板"},{"level":2,"text":"Geolocation（地理位置）","id":"geolocation-地理位置"},{"level":2,"text":"Camera / Mic（摄像头/麦克风）","id":"camera-mic-摄像头-麦克风"},{"level":2,"text":"Wake Lock（屏幕唤醒锁）","id":"wake-lock-屏幕唤醒锁"},{"level":2,"text":"Periodic Background Sync（周期性后台同步）","id":"periodic-background-sync-周期性后台同步"},{"level":2,"text":"Idle Detection（空闲检测）","id":"idle-detection-空闲检测"},{"level":2,"text":"Contact Picker（联系人选择器）","id":"contact-picker-联系人选择器"},{"level":2,"text":"权限体验设计","id":"权限体验设计"},{"level":2,"text":"能力检测","id":"能力检测"},{"level":2,"text":"回退与渐进增强","id":"回退与渐进增强"},{"level":2,"text":"Project Fugu 追踪","id":"project-fugu-追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 平台限制","id":"ios-平台限制"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私与安全","id":"隐私与安全"},{"level":2,"text":"实战案例","id":"实战案例"},{"level":2,"text":"常见反模式","id":"常见反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"推送通知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/capabilities-and-deploy/push-notifications"},"next":{"title":"测试与调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/capabilities-and-deploy/testing-and-debugging"}}